      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 49,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "If grape gatherers came to you, would they not leave some gleaning grapes? If thieves came by night, wouldn’t they steal until they had enough?",
      "ko": "포도를 거두는 자들이 네게 이르면 약간의 열매도 남기지 아니하겠고 밤에 도적이 오면 그 욕심이 차기까지 멸하느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "8bcf22ee9565dc50907b14061c19436f0fb422ede4b5e86c773540fe72a2f9d9",
      "translation_text_hash": "9d50fb68fc58b0a20d3d288eafe2c90afe377ac7a4d7fe52ca84282521590d75",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
