      "en": "Leave your fatherless children. I will preserve them alive. Let your widows trust in me.”",
      "ko": "네 고아들을 남겨 두라 내가 그들을 살려 두리라 네 과부들은 나를 의지할 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0592afc5b6acf0b15f0caacf1994267d91f45a0769cc265685f5828ead233ecd",
      "translation_text_hash": "c982d7a0644edc802cacb7182a7c1780760f260978aac2cfb7bb26aeef8a451d",
