      "en": "“Edom will become an astonishment. Everyone who passes by it will be astonished, and will hiss at all its plagues.",
      "ko": "에돔이 놀라운 것이 되리니 그리로 지나는 자마다 놀라며 그 모든 재앙을 인하여 비웃으리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "958a28ee2196d35739603b1e8ec17c1c847a1e964243087ab4af406f39b198b8",
      "translation_text_hash": "4cc3215abb318f9c4d821ad5485abc34094594bffe0b919eac2e6f574bd33dbc",
