      "en": "Behold, he will come up and fly as the eagle, and spread out his wings against Bozrah. The heart of the mighty men of Edom at that day will be as the heart of a woman in her pangs.",
      "ko": "보라 원수가 독수리 같이 날아와서 그 날개를 보스라 위에 펴는 그 날에 에돔 용사의 마음이 구로하는 여인 같으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "10c30885ae9fbc981df6f0bff788ff7ceaa4969f1fd1388a776861fbfaefff9d",
      "translation_text_hash": "753c18393759905f5cbe0ffdd0adda588458b432144297f74b8bcbbcd0f3e9f5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
