      "en": "Damascus has grown feeble, she turns herself to flee, and trembling has seized her. Anguish and sorrows have taken hold of her, as of a woman in travail.",
      "ko": "다메섹이 피곤하여 몸을 돌이켜 달아나려 하니 떨림이 그를 움켰고 해산하는 여인 같이 고통과 슬픔이 그를 잡았도다",
      "source_text_hash": "1830fa8180aa95d257a2576917401d1fec147b712c975e56223bfccbadee7a22",
      "translation_text_hash": "98bde2c5f4ef421f7922abb456376c96e0b86bf5908b00f4e71ce73cbcb0f2a9",
